    <item>
      <title>Whoami</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;┌──&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;z41f3r㉿root&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;-&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;~&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;└─$ whoami&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Z41F3R &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;Steven Guzman&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Technical support professional with more than 3 years of experience in enterprise environments, focused on infrastructure, systems, networking, and the operation of technology solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My professional experience focuses on the administration, configuration, implementation, and support of enterprise solutions, taking part in the diagnosis and resolution of issues involving software, hardware, systems, and infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This experience has allowed me to develop a practical understanding of how systems operate and are maintained in real-world environments, from day-to-day operations and technical support to troubleshooting and technical analysis.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
